    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12467" root="درك" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَرَاكِ</span></b>  an imperative verbal noun, (S,) meaning
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَدْرِكْ</span> [<i>Attain thou, reach thou, overtake thou,</i>
&amp;c.]: (K:) form the unused verb <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَرَكَ</span>: (IB:)
like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَرَاكِ</span> [from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَرَكَ</span>], meaning <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُتْرُكْ</span>. (TA.)

